    "updated_at": "2021-07-28T15:40:24Z",
    "body": "The link in the OP says \"input text 全角 禁止\" whose kanji parts translates to \"forbid fullwidth forms\". `inputmode=numeric/decimal/tel` may work if the OP wants to restrict a field to accept only digits. But if the OP wants some fields to only accept non-fullwidth alphabetic characters (全角英字) then we need a new value or some other ways to control input modes.",
    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
    "pin": null,
