    "created_at": "2021-07-28T15:55:53Z",
    "updated_at": "2021-07-28T15:55:53Z",
    "body": "That kind of feature used to be in the spec as an inputmode, I believe, but there was no implementer interest (and according to @dtapuska was \"not possible to implement in current virtual keyboard implementations\") so it was removed in https://github.com/whatwg/html/pull/3260.\r\n\r\nIn particular there used to be \"kana\" (full-width kana or romaji), \"kana-name\", \"katakana\" (full-width), \"half-width-katakana\", and \"full-width-latin\". I'm not sure if that exactly maps to what's requested here.",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "pin": null,
